<title>USA: Belco Oil names Laurence Belfer president.</title>
<headline>Belco Oil names Laurence Belfer president.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belco Oil &amp; Gas Corp said on Monday it named Laurence Belfer president, effective April 1.</p>
<p>He succeeds Robert Belfer, who will continue to serve as chairman and chief executive.</p>
<p>Laurence Belfer, who currently is executive vice president and chief operating officer, will continue to hold the COO title.</p>
<p>Belco is an independent energy company engaged in the exploration, development and production of natural gas and oil.</p>
